<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sage lifts interim shr, div.</title>
<headline>Sage lifts interim shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr ended Sept 30</p>
<p>		(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)   51.7     vs 41.3</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 31.0     vs 25.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   63.63    vs 46.55</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   79.58    vs 58.76</p>
